OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Fbecoming lighter and more confined to
OL,7,Fcoastal areas overnight. Winds
OL,8,Fcontinue to ease, although remaining
OL,9,Fbreezy along northern coasts of Devon,
OL,10,FCornwall and Somerset.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FPatchy cloud and sunny
OL,13,Fspells with some isolated light
OL,14,Fshowers at times. Feeling pleasant in
OL,15,Fany sunny spells with light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
